      "notes": [
        {
          "no": 0,
          "type": "RESERVATION",
          "note": "lhr-mia-lhr economy classic (advised charge for seats 331 days flying club foc 7 days before) advised can look at the indirect option from manchester if they want when i comes out\n2 nights boulan south beach (advised $40 per night room fee)\nbrilliant lady 10 nights 30th nov 2026 slightly smaller sea terrace $250 sailor loot total\n\nTOTAL \u00A34698.29\n\nall eratta read, esta advised ",
          "displayName": "Nicole Lawson",
          "dateModified": "2025-07-21T09:28:05",
          "systemGenerated": false,
          "key": "RS~0",
          "noteId": 0
        },
        {
          "no": 2,
          "type": "RESERVATION",
          "note": "taken \u00A3400 deposit for cruise and \u00A3150 low deposit for holiday, \u00A3250 due in 8 weeks",
          "displayName": "Nicole Lawson",
          "dateModified": "2025-07-22T14:15:19",
          "systemGenerated": false,
          "key": "RS~2",
          "noteId": 0
        },
        {
          "no": 4,
          "type": "RESERVATION",
          "note": "each passenger paid \u00A3250 (total \u00A3500)\n",
          "displayName": "Kyle Grimes",
          "dateModified": "2025-09-07T14:19:21",
          "systemGenerated": false,
          "key": "RS~4",
          "noteId": 0
        },
        {
          "no": 3,
          "type": "RESERVATION",
          "note": "Hi Harvey,\n\nI cannot see any email trail here only an out of office and you forwarded email, do you know who you have been emailing, was it someone direct as we wouldnt be able to see that.\n\nI did misread your email thought you wanted to move from 8034A to 8038A which I couldn\u0027t see any difference between, but after reading again I see it was from Deck 10 down to Deck 8.\n\nWe have changed your cabin number just now to 8038A please allow 24 hours for this to update with Virgin Voyages app, you may have to sign out and back in again to see this change.\n\nKind Regards,\n\nVirgin Atlantic Holidays",
          "displayName": "Nicole Lawson",
          "dateModified": "2025-08-02T20:21:17",
          "systemGenerated": false,
          "key": "RS~3",
          "noteId": 0
        }
      ],
