        {
          "no": 7,
          "code": "Low Deposit",
          "description": "Low Deposit",
          "note": "The full deposit amount is \u00A3175 per person plus \u00A350 booking fee, as you paid a \nlow deposit at the time of booking the remaining amount of the deposit will be due\n8 weeks after your booking has been confirmed, or at the point your full balance\nis due.\n\nPlease note:  All holidays balances are due 12 weeks prior to travel.\n\nIf you book using the low deposit scheme and then cancel your holiday, \nthe remaining deposit amount will be due on cancellation.",
