        {
          "no": 18,
          "code": "Spring Break - Jamaica, Bahamas,Mexico and Miami",
          "description": "Spring Break - Jamaica, Bahamas,Mexico and Miami",
          "note": "Each year from mid-February to mid-April certain areas in Mexico, Jamaica, \nBahamas and Miami attract groups of young Americans and Canadians looking to \ncelebrate their Spring Break. \nThis can cause a number of hotels to be very noisy during this time \nand it may affect the overall ambience of the hotels.",
