        {
          "no": 20,
          "code": "Boulan South Beach - Resort fees",
          "description": "Boulan South Beach - Resort fees",
          "note": "Boulan South Beach have a mandatory resort fee of $45 per room per night, \nplus tax which is payable locally. In order to settle this cost, you will need to \npay at the hotel when you check in.\n\nThe resort fee is set by the accommodation provider, not the tour operator, so \nVirgin Atlantic Holidays cannot control the level of the fee, and it can change at \nany time.",
